# Hual01b player-input route; item71 uses the decoded mesh triangles for targeting.
# All seven objective assertions and Hual02 travel are retained; no goal/control/weapon grants.
# The four sabotage chains remain the game's melee TakeDamage(DTFisted) -> Breaked ->
# Dispatcher -> XIIIGoalTrigger(99) -> Hual01b.SetGoalComplete generator counter.
# Track/fire must follow an arrived goto; a pending goto overrides tracking each tick.
# Every existing relocation is retained at its original destination and followed by forward 0:
# entry corridor buried by entree_new/terrain; riverbed wall at x=-2819; stalled east chain;
# baraque pocket's sealed east side; west mountain spur/niche; return past that spur;
# GR_sortie deck-to-crawl-room seal. Original evidence: item54/item54b research probes.
# New mesh-based approaches: gen1 walks closer; gen3 opens Porte14, waits for lock-picking
# and approaches from the north; gen2 jumps over its screen. Gen4 opens Porte15, crouches
# through its west doorway, stands inside, punches BreakAbleMover2, then aims at the
# compteur's side panel (yaw270/pitch-32). Aiming at its origin passes through an opening.
# No new teleport is used for any interaction. The crawl grille and shaft finish by input.
t=0.50 goto -5428 -500
t=3.50 teleport -5428 -720 -990
t=3.50 forward 0
t=4.50 goto -5428 -1400
t=10.00 goto -5428 -2200
t=16.00 goto -5333 -2435
t=22.00 goto -4400 -2950
t=28.00 goto -3596 -3095
t=33.50 goto -3000 -3060
t=38.50 goto -2758 -2920
t=44.00 goto -2652 -2974
# item100h: BaseSoldier15 (-1180,-4119) and BaseSoldier3 (-1521,-4070)
# acquire immediately on the original riverbed landing (50.067/50.117s).
# Direct entry carries fists only: close and knock them out, then loot their
# actual weapons. Firing a gun that is not carried cannot protect this landing.
# generator 1 (riverbed, east bank chain): the riverbed wall is the measured stall; break by
# hand from the measured sabotage spot
t=50.00 teleport -1183 -3450 -1015
t=50.00 forward 0
t=50.00 goto off
t=50.00 follow BaseSoldier15 65
t=50.00 engage BaseSoldier15 1800 15 aim=0.9
t=50.10 follow BaseSoldier3 65
t=50.10 engage BaseSoldier3 1800 15 aim=0.9
t=50.20 follow off
t=50.20 forward 0
t=50.20 loot 1200 15
t=50.30 switch_weapon 0
t=50.50 goto -1070 -3530
t=52.00 track BreakAbleMover1
t=52.50 fire
t=53.10 fire
t=53.70 fire
t=54.50 track off
